08-modalverben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Vielleicht, aber die Umsetzung dürfte teuer werden, das sollten wir nicht verschweigen.","speaker":"Waltraud","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Einverstanden, Transparenz über die Kosten kann nur helfen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, unsere Empfehlung dürfte auf Widerstand stoßen, aber sie müsste trotzdem geprüft werden.","speaker":"Waltraud","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich finde, sie könnte sogar auf breite Zustimmung stoßen, wenn wir die Vorteile klarer benennen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Vielleicht, aber die Umsetzung dürfte teuer werden, das sollten wir nicht verschweigen.","speaker":"Waltraud","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-08-modalverben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Einverstanden, Transparenz über die Kosten kann nur helfen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_008_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Sie könnte sogar auf breite Zustimmung stoßen, das halte ich für plausibel.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chap